{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103360","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103360","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1710336001:0":{"text":"新商品の売上データーは上がってる？","source_cn":"这批新款的销售数据回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACBE035CDAAD19B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710336002:0":{"text":"ええ。ですが伸びがイマイチで……","source_cn":"新款给销售额带来的提升并不是很明显……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4DDE478209F98E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710336003:0":{"text":"なんですって！？社内評価ではロワン坊ちゃまも満足してくださっていたし、初めて商品デザインを任されたのに……","source_cn":"怎么会这样！我好不容易第一次担任产品设计的负责人，内部...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB4416EF85D7B25B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710336004:0":{"text":"いえいえ！あなたのせいではないですよ。まさか新商品の発売日に、古聖堂が消えるなんて思わないでしょう……","source_cn":"我想这不是你的原因！谁让我们的新款发布刚好赶上圣古堂消...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AD9BAF3C4DB9323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710336005:0":{"text":"実際、他の商品も軒並み影響を受けていますから……","source_cn":"不光是你负责的新款，其他系列的销售额肯定也会受影响……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AB69018F6B7F138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document